WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.609
What the light costs.

00:02.309 --> 00:04.334
It is not only the stars.

00:04.784 --> 00:14.071
Birds that travel at night are drawn towards lights, young turtles crawl towards streets instead of the sea, and it is bad for our own health.

00:14.521 --> 00:18.582
The night sky has been getting nearly a tenth brighter every year.

00:19.032 --> 00:23.802
But this pollution is gone the moment a lamp is shaded or switched off.
